1
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:03,200
All depicted events are fictional

2
00:00:03,280 --> 00:00:06,400
and for entertainment purposes only.
Viewer discretion is advised.

3
00:00:19,560 --> 00:00:23,400
Let me care for you
until my very last breath.

4
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:26,400
Could you find it in your heart
to accept my love?

5
00:00:27,960 --> 00:00:29,480
Have I made myself clear?

6
00:00:40,200 --> 00:00:42,040
I have not had my fill of sleep.

7
00:00:44,240 --> 00:00:45,920
Dawn has not yet come.

8
00:00:46,840 --> 00:00:48,480
Let me hold you a little longer.

9
00:00:49,840 --> 00:00:52,680
Phop, it is already morning.

10
00:00:53,320 --> 00:00:56,160
Even the dove in the birdhouse
has begun to coo.

11
00:00:59,160 --> 00:01:00,680
That is not true.

12
00:01:00,760 --> 00:01:03,040
It is still quite dark outside,

13
00:01:03,560 --> 00:01:05,560
and that was an owl's cry.

14
00:01:19,400 --> 00:01:21,920
Let us remain here for a little longer.

15
00:02:09,080 --> 00:02:10,840
It is indeed morning, as you said.

16
00:02:10,919 --> 00:02:13,720
Even the dove in my birdhouse
has begun to coo.

17
00:02:25,440 --> 00:02:26,680
What is the matter?

18
00:02:27,480 --> 00:02:29,640
Did I hurt you so badly last night?

19
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:31,440
What sort of question is that?

20
00:02:35,080 --> 00:02:36,280
Last night,

21
00:02:36,360 --> 00:02:38,040
you were very smooth though.

22
00:02:39,080 --> 00:02:41,640
It was different from what Kaew said.

23
00:02:41,720 --> 00:02:43,920
You have never been involved with anyone.

24
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:46,720
How green with jealousy you are,

25
00:02:46,800 --> 00:02:47,960
my sweetheart.

26
00:02:57,000 --> 00:02:58,560
You are my first.

27
00:03:10,520 --> 00:03:11,640
And…

28
00:03:11,720 --> 00:03:13,520
Last night, why did you…

29
00:03:22,840 --> 00:03:25,880
It seems you have forgotten
how much I love to read.

30
00:03:26,800 --> 00:03:28,640
Though I lack experience,

31
00:03:29,720 --> 00:03:32,000
I have learned much

32
00:03:32,680 --> 00:03:34,360
from the scrolls of intimacy

33
00:03:34,960 --> 00:03:36,560
and the Kama Sutra.

34
00:03:42,120 --> 00:03:43,760
Where might the scrolls be?

35
00:03:43,840 --> 00:03:44,800
Let me have a look!

36
00:03:48,440 --> 00:03:50,840
No book can ever compare
with real experience.

37
00:03:50,920 --> 00:03:52,840
Shall we go once more?

38
00:03:52,920 --> 00:03:55,120
I shall teach you every position.

39
00:03:55,200 --> 00:03:56,960
Stop. It is morning already!

40
00:03:57,040 --> 00:03:59,360
Where are they? Show me your scrolls.

41
00:03:59,440 --> 00:04:00,680
Where are they kept?

42
00:04:02,560 --> 00:04:03,920
Let go! That tickles.

43
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:06,360
Stop…
I shall do it back to you.

44
00:04:06,440 --> 00:04:07,640
Stop.

45
00:04:08,760 --> 00:04:11,240
Take that, take that.

46
00:04:29,360 --> 00:04:31,520
I knew how much you loved this ring,

47
00:04:31,600 --> 00:04:33,920
so I returned to that merchant for you.

48
00:04:36,600 --> 00:04:38,520
Wear it upon your finger always.

49
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:43,280
On our wedding day, I shall replace it
with one far more precious.

50
00:04:54,200 --> 00:04:55,120
Don't touch me.

51
00:04:55,200 --> 00:04:56,640
Shall we go once more?

52
00:04:56,720 --> 00:04:58,680
I told you it is morning already.

53
00:05:03,560 --> 00:05:04,680
In my absence,

54
00:05:04,760 --> 00:05:07,520
keep a close watch over the servants, Bud.

55
00:05:07,600 --> 00:05:09,360
Yes, my Lady.

56
00:05:09,440 --> 00:05:12,640
I'll keep watch to ensure
no dishonor befalls our house.

57
00:05:21,200 --> 00:05:22,040
Phop,

58
00:05:23,680 --> 00:05:25,920
be diligent in teaching your brother.

59
00:05:26,000 --> 00:05:27,520
Waste no time playing around.

60
00:05:28,520 --> 00:05:29,560
Yes, Mother.

61
00:05:40,760 --> 00:05:41,600
Let us depart.

62
00:05:42,520 --> 00:05:44,880
There is no need
for a fussy farewell at the pier.

63
00:05:47,160 --> 00:05:50,880
Resolve at once the matter
of the culprits smuggling contraband.

64
00:05:50,960 --> 00:05:53,160
Upon my return from Song Khwae,

65
00:05:53,240 --> 00:05:58,080
you must accompany me to Lavo
to seek Lady Varna's hand in marriage.

66
00:06:15,400 --> 00:06:17,640
His Excellency is rarely seen
bearing his sword.

67
00:06:17,720 --> 00:06:19,080
He looks rather majestic.

68
00:06:20,200 --> 00:06:21,040
Indeed.

69
00:07:50,080 --> 00:07:51,960
Make haste. Be quick.

70
00:07:53,400 --> 00:07:54,760
Hey, hey, hey!

71
00:07:55,480 --> 00:07:56,480
Chuay!

72
00:07:57,760 --> 00:07:59,280
Chuay.

73
00:07:59,360 --> 00:08:00,320
-Chuay!
-What is it?

74
00:08:15,400 --> 00:08:17,280
I bought this plant

75
00:08:17,360 --> 00:08:19,600
so that we may nurture it together.

76
00:08:19,680 --> 00:08:21,880
When it blossoms and bears fruit,

77
00:08:21,960 --> 00:08:23,960
we shall admire its beauty together.

78
00:09:02,520 --> 00:09:04,400
I love him. I love him not.

79
00:09:04,480 --> 00:09:05,960
I love him.

80
00:09:06,040 --> 00:09:07,400
Of course I love him.

81
00:09:09,320 --> 00:09:10,280
Chuay.

82
00:09:10,360 --> 00:09:12,760
I told you, my illness has passed.

83
00:09:12,840 --> 00:09:14,760
You needn't watch over me
at my bedside.

84
00:09:14,840 --> 00:09:17,400
I'm not here to watch over you,
Master Klao.

85
00:09:17,480 --> 00:09:19,120
I am here to share your bed.

86
00:09:19,200 --> 00:09:20,160
Phop!

87
00:09:21,160 --> 00:09:22,000
Hey.

88
00:09:22,520 --> 00:09:24,800
I shall tell Lord Phop that

89
00:09:24,880 --> 00:09:25,840
a thief…

90
00:09:25,920 --> 00:09:29,760
broke into my quarters
and kissed my cheek.

91
00:09:29,840 --> 00:09:31,280
In that case,

92
00:09:32,440 --> 00:09:35,000
may I accept my punishment
in the form of a kiss?

93
00:09:40,440 --> 00:09:42,840
Take that.

94
00:09:42,920 --> 00:09:44,880
Smells pleasant, does it not?

95
00:09:44,960 --> 00:09:45,800
No.

96
00:09:46,920 --> 00:09:49,680
-Your cheek smells far more pleasant.
-Hey!

97
00:09:49,760 --> 00:09:51,000
Hey, don't…

98
00:09:51,800 --> 00:09:53,840
<i>What snack is this?</i>
<i>I have never seen it.</i>

99
00:09:53,920 --> 00:09:55,760
<i>It is a snack from Phichit.</i>

100
00:09:56,680 --> 00:09:58,320
<i>I taught Muan how to make it.</i>

101
00:09:58,400 --> 00:10:01,200
But this is for myself alone.

102
00:10:01,280 --> 00:10:02,960
You must not take it from me.

103
00:10:35,880 --> 00:10:37,720
Phop, the servants saw that.

104
00:10:38,480 --> 00:10:39,560
Let them witness it.

105
00:10:39,640 --> 00:10:40,960
Tonight…

106
00:10:42,280 --> 00:10:44,400
stay in my quarters
for one more night, Klao.

107
00:10:48,320 --> 00:10:51,080
I wish His Excellency and our Lady
would stay away longer.

108
00:10:51,160 --> 00:10:52,640
Master Klao and our lord

109
00:10:52,720 --> 00:10:54,280
are most happy together.

110
00:11:25,560 --> 00:11:26,800
Have I told you

111
00:11:28,080 --> 00:11:29,480
that I love you?

112
00:11:31,920 --> 00:11:33,800
You have, countless times.

113
00:11:34,360 --> 00:11:36,720
Yet I always wish to hear it once more.

114
00:11:38,880 --> 00:11:40,440
I love you.

115
00:11:41,160 --> 00:11:42,680
I love you dearly.

116
00:12:05,960 --> 00:12:07,120
Be gentle,

117
00:12:07,800 --> 00:12:10,000
or the war elephant
will yearn for another war.

118
00:12:16,080 --> 00:12:18,320
Conceal your ambitions at times, I pray.

119
00:12:19,040 --> 00:12:22,120
Even now,
the servants gossip of nothing else.

120
00:12:26,560 --> 00:12:28,480
Speaking of gossip,

121
00:12:29,520 --> 00:12:31,160
have you ever wondered

122
00:12:31,240 --> 00:12:33,000
why is it that Cherd

123
00:12:33,920 --> 00:12:36,000
can track me wherever I go?

124
00:12:36,840 --> 00:12:38,560
It is as if he can foretell

125
00:12:39,600 --> 00:12:42,760
both my destination
and the moment I shall depart.

126
00:12:46,800 --> 00:12:49,080
The night prior,
at the Pavilion of Affection…

127
00:12:50,160 --> 00:12:51,480
Word from your manor

128
00:12:51,560 --> 00:12:54,800
says that you have changed,
as if you were a different person.

129
00:12:55,800 --> 00:12:57,600
He spoke as though

130
00:12:59,280 --> 00:13:01,160
someone in our manor
has a loose tongue.

131
00:13:03,920 --> 00:13:05,280
Whom do you suspect?

132
00:13:07,080 --> 00:13:10,440
The servants in our manor
are entirely trustworthy.

133
00:13:11,960 --> 00:13:14,400
I do not think it is one of the servants.

134
00:13:15,080 --> 00:13:17,680
Perhaps it is…

135
00:13:20,960 --> 00:13:22,160
-Lady Bud.
-Aunt Bud.

136
00:13:29,560 --> 00:13:30,880
What was that?

137
00:13:30,960 --> 00:13:34,680
You claimed that Klao borrowed your
garments to attire himself as a woman?

138
00:13:34,760 --> 00:13:37,000
Was he dressing for a love affair?

139
00:13:38,080 --> 00:13:40,280
Good heavens!
I think that was not the case.

140
00:13:40,360 --> 00:13:42,320
It would seem he dressed for a play,

141
00:13:42,400 --> 00:13:45,840
though I believe he disguised himself
to investigate certain matters.

142
00:13:45,920 --> 00:13:48,320
-I think you are wrong.
-Do you truly think so?

143
00:13:48,400 --> 00:13:50,000
How else am I meant to think?

144
00:13:50,080 --> 00:13:50,960
But that…

145
00:13:51,040 --> 00:13:52,080
That was how it went.

146
00:13:52,160 --> 00:13:53,560
Lady Euang.

147
00:13:56,200 --> 00:13:57,800
Handsome one,

148
00:13:57,880 --> 00:13:59,600
you have returned again.

149
00:14:01,120 --> 00:14:02,120
How did it fare?

150
00:14:02,200 --> 00:14:03,680
As I told you last time,

151
00:14:04,440 --> 00:14:06,160
did you find Klao there?

152
00:14:06,240 --> 00:14:07,560
I did,

153
00:14:08,080 --> 00:14:10,560
but he ran into the House of Pleasure.

154
00:14:12,560 --> 00:14:14,200
What think you, Lady Euang?

155
00:14:14,840 --> 00:14:17,160
Is he in search of the truth
of his own past?

156
00:14:20,160 --> 00:14:21,160
That I know not.

157
00:14:21,240 --> 00:14:24,680
But these days, he speaks with
far more sense than he did before.

158
00:14:25,600 --> 00:14:27,760
I believe some of his memories
have returned.

159
00:14:31,880 --> 00:14:32,920
At this very moment,

160
00:14:33,680 --> 00:14:35,960
what is it that he schemes to do?

161
00:14:51,000 --> 00:14:56,000
He is troubled by
the illicit taking of opium.

162
00:14:57,080 --> 00:15:00,320
He is seeking the one who…

163
00:15:00,400 --> 00:15:01,240
This one.

164
00:15:03,400 --> 00:15:04,680
I want it.

165
00:15:04,760 --> 00:15:06,560
Very well.

166
00:15:13,960 --> 00:15:14,920
I'll take them all.

167
00:15:15,000 --> 00:15:16,320
All of these.

168
00:15:19,720 --> 00:15:20,920
Thank you.

169
00:16:00,440 --> 00:16:03,520
Wounded as he is,
he could not have fled far.

170
00:16:03,600 --> 00:16:05,880
Have you searched for this man thoroughly

171
00:16:05,960 --> 00:16:07,480
at the market,

172
00:16:07,560 --> 00:16:10,080
the opium den,
and the House of Pleasure?

173
00:16:12,800 --> 00:16:13,920
Certainly, Lord Phop.

174
00:16:15,240 --> 00:16:16,920
Such matters require time.

175
00:16:17,640 --> 00:16:19,440
Why must you be in such haste?

176
00:16:19,520 --> 00:16:21,480
Dear Klao witnessed the bandits

177
00:16:21,560 --> 00:16:23,640
in the act of stealing the seized goods.

178
00:16:23,720 --> 00:16:27,000
The culprits knew where the keys
and contraband were hidden.

179
00:16:28,080 --> 00:16:29,080
Perchance,

180
00:16:29,160 --> 00:16:32,600
the mastermind behind this affair
lies within the department itself.

181
00:16:43,200 --> 00:16:44,040
Are you certain?

182
00:16:46,160 --> 00:16:47,560
But has Dear Klao

183
00:16:48,280 --> 00:16:50,440
recovered from his madness
and loss of memory?

184
00:16:51,160 --> 00:16:54,000
He speaks with far greater sense
and reason than before.

185
00:16:54,080 --> 00:16:55,880
I believe he can be trusted now.

186
00:16:58,640 --> 00:16:59,640
If such is the case,

187
00:17:00,520 --> 00:17:03,080
we must pursue the truth
with even greater caution.

188
00:17:03,760 --> 00:17:04,960
No one can be trusted.

189
00:17:13,240 --> 00:17:14,079
Lord Phop,

190
00:17:15,880 --> 00:17:18,400
you must never speak of
this matter here again.

191
00:17:23,160 --> 00:17:24,520
I must go patrol now.

192
00:17:46,360 --> 00:17:48,960
I told my client that
I required the privy.

193
00:17:49,040 --> 00:17:51,040
I have but a moment to spare, Cherd.

194
00:17:51,880 --> 00:17:53,080
This is already plenty.

195
00:18:01,160 --> 00:18:04,480
What matter brought Klao
to seek you out the other night?

196
00:18:06,760 --> 00:18:07,960
What else could it be?

197
00:18:09,520 --> 00:18:10,960
He came seeking

198
00:18:13,600 --> 00:18:14,880
my beauty, of course.

199
00:18:15,680 --> 00:18:17,440
Trifle not with me.

200
00:18:17,520 --> 00:18:19,080
Answer me,

201
00:18:19,600 --> 00:18:20,560
or I shall--

202
00:18:20,640 --> 00:18:22,040
Or you shall what?

203
00:18:24,000 --> 00:18:26,680
With but a single cry from me,

204
00:18:27,800 --> 00:18:29,400
the patrolmen outside

205
00:18:29,480 --> 00:18:31,120
shall be upon you at once.

206
00:18:38,760 --> 00:18:40,880
You are fleeing from them?

207
00:18:44,120 --> 00:18:45,400
Ouch!

208
00:18:48,440 --> 00:18:50,040
You are wounded also.

209
00:18:50,640 --> 00:18:52,760
-What was it that you did?
-Silence!

210
00:18:53,680 --> 00:18:55,120
Answer me this instant.

211
00:18:55,800 --> 00:18:58,040
For what matter did Klao seek you out?

212
00:18:58,120 --> 00:18:59,320
What was it that he knew?

213
00:19:01,000 --> 00:19:01,840
Well…

214
00:19:05,560 --> 00:19:08,960
He knows nothing of
your opium meeting place.

215
00:19:18,960 --> 00:19:19,920
Hand over that ring.

216
00:19:25,520 --> 00:19:26,560
The next time

217
00:19:27,280 --> 00:19:28,760
he comes to seek me,

218
00:19:30,120 --> 00:19:32,720
I may perchance let it slip.

219
00:19:38,080 --> 00:19:41,080
Then you may cease this jealousy,
for we both know…

220
00:19:42,000 --> 00:19:45,640
you're terrified I've learned
the truth about you.

221
00:19:53,800 --> 00:19:56,000
If you slip up,
I'll bring about your demise.

222
00:19:57,600 --> 00:19:58,760
You would not dare.

223
00:20:00,160 --> 00:20:01,800
But my master surely would.

224
00:20:04,080 --> 00:20:07,000
We shall see
if you can keep up this bravery, Pim.

225
00:20:13,840 --> 00:20:14,720
Hold, my Lady.

226
00:20:15,760 --> 00:20:16,920
Who is that man?

227
00:20:17,440 --> 00:20:19,000
Has he in any way harmed you?

228
00:20:21,040 --> 00:20:22,000
It was nothing.

229
00:20:22,520 --> 00:20:24,800
He merely mistook me for another.

230
00:20:24,880 --> 00:20:26,400
I shall take my leave now.

231
00:20:44,840 --> 00:20:48,320
Were you a lady, Master Kaew,

232
00:20:48,400 --> 00:20:52,600
I dare say your charms would captivate
the hearts of every gentleman.

233
00:21:20,160 --> 00:21:22,520
And now,
the batter is ready for frying, Klao.

234
00:21:24,040 --> 00:21:26,480
Allow me to attend to
this matter myself, Masters.

235
00:21:26,560 --> 00:21:29,080
If we leave the frying to Master Klao,

236
00:21:29,160 --> 00:21:31,320
I fear Lord Phop will return
before it's done

237
00:21:31,400 --> 00:21:32,760
and spoil the surprise.

238
00:21:35,240 --> 00:21:36,080
Come.

239
00:21:38,600 --> 00:21:39,840
Good heavens!

240
00:21:41,080 --> 00:21:43,800
You didn't say this batch
of <i>khanom kong</i> was for Phop.

241
00:21:43,880 --> 00:21:46,480
I shouldn't have taken this job from you.

242
00:21:46,560 --> 00:21:48,080
Pay it no mind, Kaew.

243
00:21:49,240 --> 00:21:51,760
To see you smile

244
00:21:51,840 --> 00:21:53,640
and cook once more

245
00:21:53,720 --> 00:21:54,920
already delights me.

246
00:21:57,720 --> 00:21:59,840
I only did as you taught me,

247
00:22:00,400 --> 00:22:01,880
which was to love myself more,

248
00:22:02,800 --> 00:22:05,120
so that I would never have to
cry over him again.

249
00:22:08,200 --> 00:22:11,080
I have prepared
this meal for you today, you see.

250
00:22:14,480 --> 00:22:15,320
Here.

251
00:22:22,240 --> 00:22:24,320
Do you often bring me meals like this?

252
00:22:25,440 --> 00:22:26,560
Not at all, Master.

253
00:22:26,640 --> 00:22:29,160
He prepares it for the Physician daily.

254
00:22:29,240 --> 00:22:31,000
-But after--
-Buaphan!

255
00:22:33,600 --> 00:22:36,040
Have I not told you
to speak of him no more?

256
00:22:38,080 --> 00:22:39,120
Or else,

257
00:22:39,200 --> 00:22:41,240
I shall move to Pak Nam Pho tomorrow.

258
00:22:46,000 --> 00:22:48,160
You once prepared it for Jom
every single day,

259
00:22:49,960 --> 00:22:51,960
but now that this has come to pass,

260
00:22:53,280 --> 00:22:54,840
I wonder how he fares.

261
00:22:57,600 --> 00:22:59,720
He would likely fare well enough
without me.

262
00:23:01,120 --> 00:23:03,320
Let him feast on dried herbs

263
00:23:03,920 --> 00:23:05,560
and live on his remedies.

264
00:23:07,160 --> 00:23:08,440
Klao!

265
00:23:08,520 --> 00:23:09,920
Dear Klao!

266
00:23:10,680 --> 00:23:12,120
Has Kaew come to this manor?

267
00:23:51,800 --> 00:23:52,800
How heartless of you.

268
00:23:52,880 --> 00:23:54,800
You stopped bringing food to my manor

269
00:23:54,880 --> 00:23:56,120
and gave it all to Klao?

270
00:23:56,200 --> 00:23:57,240
You deserve it.

271
00:23:58,720 --> 00:24:00,560
Who was heartless first?

272
00:24:16,560 --> 00:24:17,400
Forgive me.

273
00:24:22,080 --> 00:24:23,920
Do not journey to Pak Nam Pho, Kaew.

274
00:24:24,680 --> 00:24:26,000
I sought you at your manor,

275
00:24:27,440 --> 00:24:29,360
and upon not finding you there,

276
00:24:30,560 --> 00:24:32,760
my heart burned with restless unease.

277
00:24:36,960 --> 00:24:39,720
If you truly leave,
I fear I couldn't bear this life.

278
00:24:42,680 --> 00:24:44,400
But do you not find me tiresome?

279
00:24:46,240 --> 00:24:47,960
Do you not wish me gone?

280
00:24:48,040 --> 00:24:49,320
Not anymore.

281
00:24:49,960 --> 00:24:52,120
My only wish
is to have you by my side, Kaew.

282
00:24:55,840 --> 00:24:58,280
I am well aware of the wrongs
I have done to you.

283
00:24:59,120 --> 00:25:01,480
You may not forgive me.

284
00:25:03,160 --> 00:25:05,600
Yet I beg you to grant me another chance.

285
00:25:07,240 --> 00:25:11,000
From this day forth,
I shall cherish you with the utmost care,

286
00:25:11,080 --> 00:25:13,560
that I may atone for the wrongs
of my past.

287
00:25:23,080 --> 00:25:25,280
How can I remain by your side,

288
00:25:28,080 --> 00:25:30,360
and what would I be to you, Jom?

289
00:25:35,440 --> 00:25:36,840
Even that, you cannot answer.

290
00:25:43,200 --> 00:25:44,040
Just eat,

291
00:25:44,640 --> 00:25:46,520
you have gone without food
for too long.

292
00:25:48,520 --> 00:25:52,520
From this day forth, I shall have
my servants deliver meals to your manor.

293
00:25:52,600 --> 00:25:53,520
That shall suffice.

294
00:26:04,880 --> 00:26:05,840
Kaew…

295
00:26:05,920 --> 00:26:06,920
I am truly sorry.

296
00:26:10,400 --> 00:26:12,920
I beg you to grant me another chance.
Kaew…

297
00:26:13,000 --> 00:26:14,240
Kaew.

298
00:26:19,640 --> 00:26:20,800
Kaew, forgive me.

299
00:26:24,760 --> 00:26:26,160
Pray forgive me, Kaew.

300
00:26:28,400 --> 00:26:30,520
One more chance, Kaew. I beg of you.

301
00:26:45,600 --> 00:26:47,000
Phop.

302
00:26:47,080 --> 00:26:48,600
You have returned?

303
00:26:51,680 --> 00:26:52,880
If I have not,

304
00:26:53,400 --> 00:26:55,040
who then kissed you?

305
00:26:56,160 --> 00:26:57,280
Muan, was it?

306
00:27:04,280 --> 00:27:06,640
Are our good physician
and Kaew at our manor?

307
00:27:08,360 --> 00:27:09,640
Have the two reconciled?

308
00:27:11,440 --> 00:27:13,320
Matters are still far from well.

309
00:27:16,320 --> 00:27:17,800
It is not easy for Kaew.

310
00:27:18,920 --> 00:27:20,480
He has suffered much pain.

311
00:27:23,040 --> 00:27:24,600
It is not for Jom either.

312
00:27:26,440 --> 00:27:27,600
He is a physician,

313
00:27:28,440 --> 00:27:30,760
highly respected by many.

314
00:27:33,240 --> 00:27:36,720
Even to admit the truth to himself
is difficult enough.

315
00:27:44,320 --> 00:27:45,800
I can never thank you enough

316
00:27:47,000 --> 00:27:48,640
for facing your own heart

317
00:27:48,720 --> 00:27:51,120
and having the will
to keep me by your side.

318
00:28:03,640 --> 00:28:06,520
And I shall be by your side,
now and forevermore.

319
00:28:15,960 --> 00:28:17,600
I am sorry, Kaew.

320
00:28:19,160 --> 00:28:20,480
Pray give me a chance.

321
00:28:21,120 --> 00:28:23,040
-I am sorry.
-Then answer me.

322
00:28:24,080 --> 00:28:25,760
You cannot even answer that.

323
00:28:28,040 --> 00:28:30,160
<i>If I find out</i>

324
00:28:30,240 --> 00:28:32,440
<i>who the true culprit is,</i>

325
00:28:33,040 --> 00:28:35,360
<i>I will probably be</i>
<i>sent back to the present.</i>

326
00:28:35,440 --> 00:28:36,520
<i>If that is so,</i>

327
00:28:37,120 --> 00:28:39,480
<i>I will not be able to be with Phop.</i>

328
00:28:43,080 --> 00:28:45,080
<i>Should we not pursue the truth,</i>

329
00:28:45,880 --> 00:28:49,840
<i>we shall never be able to clear</i>
<i>my father's name from my past life.</i>

330
00:28:59,320 --> 00:29:00,160
<i>See?</i>

331
00:29:00,880 --> 00:29:03,120
<i>Now that I realize</i>
<i>I am the same person as Klao,</i>

332
00:29:03,200 --> 00:29:06,040
<i>even my thoughts have taken on</i>
<i>this archaic tone.</i>

333
00:29:13,360 --> 00:29:15,920
Muan said you prepared this
for me yourself.

334
00:29:18,640 --> 00:29:19,520
It is divine.

335
00:29:30,720 --> 00:29:32,920
<i>Is there any way to solve the mystery</i>

336
00:29:33,640 --> 00:29:35,120
<i>without leaving him behind?</i>

337
00:29:47,520 --> 00:29:48,640
What is this?

338
00:29:49,320 --> 00:29:51,520
-You always spend all your time with it.
-Hey!

339
00:29:53,400 --> 00:29:54,320
Phop, give me that!

340
00:29:55,320 --> 00:29:57,480
Give it to me. Hand it over!

341
00:29:57,560 --> 00:30:00,560
Let me see it
so that my doubts may be laid to rest.

342
00:30:12,560 --> 00:30:13,400
Phop.

343
00:30:14,840 --> 00:30:16,440
Give it to me.

344
00:30:16,520 --> 00:30:18,320
Do not, Phop. I am ticklish.

345
00:30:22,720 --> 00:30:24,480
A record of the case,

346
00:30:24,560 --> 00:30:27,000
written in Farangi script.

347
00:30:27,960 --> 00:30:29,520
I cannot make sense of it.

348
00:30:31,920 --> 00:30:33,960
Why do you withhold it from me?

349
00:30:35,080 --> 00:30:37,400
You promised
you would share everything with me.

350
00:30:42,800 --> 00:30:45,400
There are certain things
I cannot show you.

351
00:30:53,960 --> 00:30:57,320
You truly have a fondness
for drawing, do you not?

352
00:31:00,800 --> 00:31:02,760
What creature did you illustrate?

353
00:31:04,280 --> 00:31:05,440
Is it a crocodile

354
00:31:07,160 --> 00:31:08,360
or a monitor lizard?

355
00:31:09,720 --> 00:31:11,840
Gosh! It is no monitor lizard.

356
00:31:12,800 --> 00:31:14,560
Stop asking and give it back!

357
00:31:19,040 --> 00:31:20,200
What about this?

358
00:31:20,880 --> 00:31:22,080
What is this emblem?

359
00:31:22,160 --> 00:31:23,600
A sacred fig leaf?

360
00:31:24,560 --> 00:31:26,160
Do you like this kind of leaf?

361
00:31:31,760 --> 00:31:34,560
Farangi writing.

362
00:31:34,640 --> 00:31:36,040
What does this signify?

363
00:31:37,680 --> 00:31:39,120
It reads…

364
00:31:39,840 --> 00:31:41,280
"Ei-luv-yu."

365
00:31:41,840 --> 00:31:43,520
It means…

366
00:31:43,600 --> 00:31:44,960
"I love you."

367
00:31:46,240 --> 00:31:47,600
You know what it means?

368
00:31:51,160 --> 00:31:52,080
It was a guess.

369
00:31:53,160 --> 00:31:56,560
It is evident that
this creature resembles me.

370
00:31:57,960 --> 00:32:00,160
As for this grumpy-looking cat,

371
00:32:02,400 --> 00:32:03,760
it does rather resemble you.

372
00:32:07,440 --> 00:32:12,040
The monitor lizard is depicted as
wanting to give the grumpy cat a kiss.

373
00:32:40,240 --> 00:32:42,080
I shall eat every last bite.

374
00:32:42,160 --> 00:32:44,480
I would even swallow the banana leaves.

375
00:32:49,680 --> 00:32:51,360
Never in all my life

376
00:32:52,240 --> 00:32:54,720
has anyone done such a thing for me,

377
00:32:55,560 --> 00:32:56,880
not even my mother.

378
00:33:00,080 --> 00:33:01,600
Never in all my life,

379
00:33:01,680 --> 00:33:03,520
have I done such a thing for anyone.

380
00:33:28,720 --> 00:33:30,880
Pray return to me soon, my Phop.

381
00:33:30,960 --> 00:33:32,440
Certainly.

382
00:33:32,520 --> 00:33:34,720
I shall thoroughly look into the matter

383
00:33:34,800 --> 00:33:36,040
as we have discussed.

384
00:33:37,760 --> 00:33:39,960
Pray wait for my return at the manor.

385
00:33:40,840 --> 00:33:43,200
Do not wander elsewhere.

386
00:33:43,280 --> 00:33:44,960
Certainly.

387
00:33:52,880 --> 00:33:54,880
It is not only the manor that has changed.

388
00:33:54,960 --> 00:33:56,760
In these past few days alone,

389
00:33:56,840 --> 00:33:59,240
you yourself
have likewise changed greatly.

390
00:34:00,960 --> 00:34:02,360
-Suddenly…
-Good heavens!

391
00:34:02,440 --> 00:34:05,440
…you no longer speak
as a man from Phichit.

392
00:34:05,520 --> 00:34:07,880
You also attend to the cares
of the household,

393
00:34:07,960 --> 00:34:10,679
harbor no desire to venture outside,

394
00:34:10,760 --> 00:34:13,639
and are thoroughly content

395
00:34:13,719 --> 00:34:16,320
in both body and mind, Master.

396
00:34:19,320 --> 00:34:20,320
Indeed, it is so.

397
00:34:22,159 --> 00:34:23,000
But…

398
00:34:23,520 --> 00:34:26,080
Uncle and Aunt
are to return this evening.

399
00:34:27,800 --> 00:34:29,679
Yet I see no harm in such a matter.

400
00:34:30,760 --> 00:34:33,000
The morrow has not yet arrived.

401
00:34:33,080 --> 00:34:35,239
Then why not simply be happy today?

402
00:34:49,760 --> 00:34:50,600
Good heavens!

403
00:34:51,480 --> 00:34:53,800
Has our good aunt not yet returned?

404
00:35:02,520 --> 00:35:04,760
Your journey here is but in vain.

405
00:35:04,840 --> 00:35:05,880
In the end…

406
00:35:05,960 --> 00:35:10,400
you have only come to help me arrange
these crown flowers into pots for Phop.

407
00:35:12,600 --> 00:35:13,600
This is indeed good.

408
00:35:13,680 --> 00:35:16,800
To be able to make something for the Lord,

409
00:35:16,880 --> 00:35:18,840
I am more than glad to do this.

410
00:35:23,520 --> 00:35:25,080
Lady Varna,

411
00:35:26,160 --> 00:35:28,560
do you truly love Phop to such an extent?

412
00:35:31,040 --> 00:35:34,320
To call it "love" might be overstated.

413
00:35:35,200 --> 00:35:36,520
I…

414
00:35:36,600 --> 00:35:39,160
I cannot claim to know him
to such a degree.

415
00:35:39,920 --> 00:35:40,760
Yet…

416
00:35:42,320 --> 00:35:44,520
you are soon to be wedded to him.

417
00:35:45,760 --> 00:35:48,640
Since the elders have decreed as such,

418
00:35:49,600 --> 00:35:53,360
how could I possibly raise any objection?

419
00:35:59,920 --> 00:36:00,800
Then…

420
00:36:01,520 --> 00:36:02,960
To speak truthfully,

421
00:36:04,120 --> 00:36:06,520
what is it that you want, Lady Varna?

422
00:36:06,600 --> 00:36:08,360
Or what is it that you want to be?

423
00:36:16,960 --> 00:36:18,640
I…

424
00:36:26,120 --> 00:36:27,640
I truly do not know.

425
00:36:29,120 --> 00:36:32,800
No one has ever asked me that until now.

426
00:36:38,440 --> 00:36:39,640
Since my birth,

427
00:36:40,720 --> 00:36:42,840
I have been but my father's daughter.

428
00:36:44,280 --> 00:36:45,480
When I come of age,

429
00:36:46,080 --> 00:36:47,760
I must wed

430
00:36:47,840 --> 00:36:50,040
and become a wife.

431
00:36:51,040 --> 00:36:52,520
Such is all I have ever known.

432
00:36:59,800 --> 00:37:03,800
And, Lady Varna, what is it
that you take pleasure in doing?

433
00:37:09,760 --> 00:37:12,440
I am fond of floral crafts

434
00:37:14,360 --> 00:37:15,360
and…

435
00:37:16,120 --> 00:37:17,520
handicrafts,

436
00:37:18,160 --> 00:37:20,800
as you are, perhaps.

437
00:37:23,760 --> 00:37:25,720
I am fond of the capital.

438
00:37:26,920 --> 00:37:27,840
Here,

439
00:37:27,920 --> 00:37:30,320
it is adorned with such beauty,

440
00:37:31,160 --> 00:37:33,440
and there is
no lack of pleasures to pursue.

441
00:37:36,360 --> 00:37:37,720
High Lord Soontrapinit,

442
00:37:37,800 --> 00:37:39,400
father to Lord Harn,

443
00:37:39,480 --> 00:37:40,720
once told me that

444
00:37:40,800 --> 00:37:42,080
if I were to…

445
00:37:43,600 --> 00:37:46,160
wed Lord Phop,

446
00:37:47,280 --> 00:37:50,240
I might be able to settle here
in the capital.

447
00:37:50,320 --> 00:37:53,120
I would no longer have to return
and be alone in Lavo.

448
00:38:17,080 --> 00:38:20,360
You are free to pursue
that which brings you joy,

449
00:38:20,440 --> 00:38:22,280
be it a lady of the court

450
00:38:22,360 --> 00:38:24,920
or a lady-in-waiting,
and to stand upon your own feet.

451
00:38:25,000 --> 00:38:26,360
Or…

452
00:38:27,800 --> 00:38:28,960
follow your heart

453
00:38:30,280 --> 00:38:31,880
in working with flowers.

454
00:38:38,240 --> 00:38:40,640
You were born a lady in your own right,

455
00:38:41,400 --> 00:38:45,360
bound not to be merely someone's daughter

456
00:38:45,440 --> 00:38:47,920
or someone's wife.

457
00:38:50,240 --> 00:38:52,720
Your worth is far greater than that.

458
00:39:48,680 --> 00:39:49,560
Lord Phop.

459
00:39:49,640 --> 00:39:51,600
The meeting place for the opium smuggling

460
00:39:51,680 --> 00:39:54,400
was recorded in the notes
in a foreign script.

461
00:39:54,480 --> 00:39:56,160
What manner of peculiarity is this?

462
00:39:56,240 --> 00:39:59,800
It is connected to
his previous disappearance.

463
00:40:00,680 --> 00:40:02,720
Were that location of no significance,

464
00:40:03,280 --> 00:40:06,280
such a dire fate
would never have befallen Klao.

465
00:40:06,360 --> 00:40:08,400
The fifteenth night of the waning moon.

466
00:40:08,480 --> 00:40:10,080
The second period.

467
00:40:10,800 --> 00:40:13,480
The abandoned hut by the pond,

468
00:40:13,560 --> 00:40:16,280
deep within the woods of Wat Sema.

469
00:40:16,360 --> 00:40:17,880
This must be it.

470
00:40:18,800 --> 00:40:21,600
Before suffering from amnesia,

471
00:40:23,560 --> 00:40:26,120
I discovered the location
of the opium meeting place.

472
00:40:26,760 --> 00:40:28,080
Thus, I recorded it.

473
00:40:30,080 --> 00:40:33,160
Why have I not asked for your help sooner?

474
00:40:37,560 --> 00:40:38,400
That is so.

475
00:40:39,480 --> 00:40:41,040
Why have you not asked me?

476
00:40:45,280 --> 00:40:47,200
At that time,

477
00:40:47,280 --> 00:40:49,880
I had not yet regained my memories.

478
00:40:49,960 --> 00:40:54,360
Thus, I could not bring myself
to tell you everything.

479
00:40:56,400 --> 00:40:57,600
Oh, Phop.

480
00:40:58,720 --> 00:40:59,800
Perchance,

481
00:41:00,320 --> 00:41:03,800
within that very place,
there may lie the evidence

482
00:41:03,880 --> 00:41:05,840
revealing the mastermind behind this.

483
00:41:09,080 --> 00:41:10,320
Of course.

484
00:41:10,400 --> 00:41:12,160
I shall look into this matter.

485
00:41:17,400 --> 00:41:19,000
However, there remains one issue.

486
00:41:21,560 --> 00:41:24,160
Which Wat Sema is it?

487
00:41:25,920 --> 00:41:28,560
The nearest temples are
Wat Sema Muang, Wat Sema Khu,

488
00:41:28,640 --> 00:41:30,120
and Wat Sema Thong.

489
00:41:30,680 --> 00:41:32,720
It would be best to deploy
the patrol units

490
00:41:32,800 --> 00:41:34,880
in order to search all three temples.

491
00:41:38,720 --> 00:41:39,760
Lord Phop.

492
00:41:40,480 --> 00:41:43,280
Klao's note is but proof without origin.

493
00:41:44,080 --> 00:41:46,280
It's not enough to mobilize the patrol.

494
00:41:47,880 --> 00:41:50,600
Ascertain first which temple it is.

495
00:41:51,440 --> 00:41:53,680
Then we shall discuss this further.

496
00:42:07,560 --> 00:42:09,960
Cherd has been at Thong's tavern all day.

497
00:42:10,040 --> 00:42:12,240
-Pray, set your mind at ease.
-Good.

498
00:42:12,320 --> 00:42:15,480
What of the records
for Lord Preechaphibal's case?

499
00:42:16,400 --> 00:42:17,880
I have searched everywhere.

500
00:42:17,960 --> 00:42:21,080
Yet the opium trading permit you seek
cannot be found.

501
00:42:26,680 --> 00:42:28,160
How can this be?

502
00:42:30,120 --> 00:42:31,760
Search within the city as well.

503
00:42:31,840 --> 00:42:34,440
-Someone may be keeping it hidden there.
-Yes, my Lord.

504
00:44:31,360 --> 00:44:34,400
<i>Lady Varna, I hope you come to know</i>

505
00:44:34,480 --> 00:44:37,480
<i>who you wish to be</i>
<i>and what you wish to achieve.</i>

506
00:44:48,320 --> 00:44:49,240
Klao!

507
00:44:49,840 --> 00:44:51,400
Where is my child?

508
00:44:51,480 --> 00:44:54,080
Where have you taken On and my child?

509
00:44:54,160 --> 00:44:55,960
Pray, wait a moment.

510
00:44:56,040 --> 00:44:57,320
Aunt Bud and Aunt Euang,

511
00:44:57,400 --> 00:44:59,760
I was with Lady Varna all afternoon.

512
00:44:59,840 --> 00:45:01,480
I know nothing.

513
00:45:02,120 --> 00:45:03,440
What has happened?

514
00:45:03,520 --> 00:45:06,080
-Have your children disappeared?
-Obviously.

515
00:45:06,720 --> 00:45:09,360
My servant told me that
your friend came for a visit.

516
00:45:10,080 --> 00:45:12,200
Boon and On came
to play with that person,

517
00:45:12,280 --> 00:45:14,800
but soon after, three of them disappeared.

518
00:45:14,880 --> 00:45:16,240
My friend?

519
00:45:17,280 --> 00:45:18,680
Do you refer to Jom and Kaew?

520
00:45:18,760 --> 00:45:19,800
No, I do not.

521
00:45:20,680 --> 00:45:21,880
My servant said that

522
00:45:21,960 --> 00:45:24,440
this person bears a grievous wound
upon the left arm.

523
00:45:25,000 --> 00:45:26,600
Who is this friend of yours?

524
00:45:29,680 --> 00:45:31,800
A grievous wound upon the left arm.

525
00:45:37,400 --> 00:45:41,240
<i>Wat Bot, oh, the temple of old</i>

526
00:45:43,000 --> 00:45:47,320
<i>Where seven toddy palms stand tall as told</i>

527
00:45:49,720 --> 00:45:55,720
<i>Khun Thong went forth on the raid</i>

528
00:45:56,960 --> 00:46:03,840
<i>Still, he has yet to return</i>
<i>For the sweet embrace</i>

529
00:46:03,920 --> 00:46:08,640
<i>Wrapping food in a bundle</i>

530
00:46:09,360 --> 00:46:14,160
<i>I rowed out to look for my angel</i>

531
00:46:15,720 --> 00:46:19,960
<i>Yet the rumors had already spread</i>

532
00:46:22,200 --> 00:46:25,040
<i>That Khun Thong had met</i>

533
00:46:26,040 --> 00:46:29,800
<i>His fate</i>

534
00:46:32,200 --> 00:46:33,120
Cherd!

535
00:46:34,480 --> 00:46:37,680
You did not spare even children?
You are but scum of the earth!

536
00:46:38,400 --> 00:46:39,400
Hey!

537
00:46:42,800 --> 00:46:45,000
Brother Klao,
why must you hurt Brother Cherd?

538
00:46:45,080 --> 00:46:49,040
-He played with me.
-And sang me a lullaby.

539
00:46:50,440 --> 00:46:51,360
Good heavens!

540
00:46:52,280 --> 00:46:53,720
No need to lay blame upon him.

541
00:46:53,800 --> 00:46:55,560
He simply is not fond of me.

542
00:47:00,680 --> 00:47:03,360
That is enough playing for today.

543
00:47:03,440 --> 00:47:05,960
Return to the manor,
lest your mothers worry.

544
00:47:08,240 --> 00:47:09,600
Off with the charade.

545
00:47:12,200 --> 00:47:13,080
Ouch!

546
00:47:14,360 --> 00:47:15,920
Your arm is wounded.

547
00:47:17,320 --> 00:47:19,560
You truly were trying
to seize the contraband.

548
00:47:19,640 --> 00:47:21,160
Ouch! It hurts!

549
00:47:21,240 --> 00:47:22,520
Boon and On, help me!

550
00:47:22,600 --> 00:47:24,680
Ow! Help me, please!

551
00:47:25,480 --> 00:47:26,600
Boon.

552
00:47:26,680 --> 00:47:27,520
Ow!

553
00:47:44,360 --> 00:47:47,360
You intended to lure me here to my demise,

554
00:47:47,440 --> 00:47:50,200
for the plot at that hut failed,
did you not?

555
00:47:56,560 --> 00:47:58,560
You truly have regained memories?

556
00:48:02,960 --> 00:48:06,840
So, the rumors that you are seeking
the truth are indeed true.

557
00:48:07,600 --> 00:48:08,600
Yes.

558
00:48:10,320 --> 00:48:11,360
And

559
00:48:12,080 --> 00:48:14,640
I am drawing closer to it
with every passing moment.

560
00:48:17,680 --> 00:48:19,840
I shall not grant mercy to you
or your master.

561
00:48:24,280 --> 00:48:25,880
Klao.

562
00:48:28,680 --> 00:48:29,600
Are you injured?

563
00:48:33,720 --> 00:48:35,760
Leave this ground at once,

564
00:48:35,840 --> 00:48:38,000
or I shall throw you in a cell.

565
00:48:38,680 --> 00:48:39,520
Boon!

566
00:48:39,600 --> 00:48:40,640
-My dear On!
-Boon!

567
00:48:40,720 --> 00:48:42,560
-On.
-Boon.

568
00:48:47,320 --> 00:48:48,640
There.

569
00:48:49,200 --> 00:48:50,560
You possess a blade as well?

570
00:48:52,840 --> 00:48:54,480
Klao.

571
00:48:54,560 --> 00:48:56,560
You brought such peril upon the household?

572
00:48:57,480 --> 00:48:59,560
I shall report this to His Excellency.

573
00:49:20,760 --> 00:49:21,600
Phop.

574
00:49:22,680 --> 00:49:24,880
I entrusted the manor to your care.

575
00:49:24,960 --> 00:49:27,160
How then did it come to this state?

576
00:49:29,480 --> 00:49:31,760
I sincerely apologize, Aunt.

577
00:49:31,840 --> 00:49:32,960
I…

578
00:49:33,560 --> 00:49:36,400
I promise that
it shall never happen again.

579
00:49:37,080 --> 00:49:40,040
Never again
shall there be such an incident,

580
00:49:41,760 --> 00:49:42,880
for you

581
00:49:43,680 --> 00:49:46,200
shall no longer remain in my household!

582
00:49:46,280 --> 00:49:47,200
Father!

583
00:49:47,280 --> 00:49:48,360
My decision is final.

584
00:49:49,360 --> 00:49:51,040
You squandered your days away

585
00:49:51,960 --> 00:49:54,160
and wasted yourself
at the House of Pleasure

586
00:49:54,240 --> 00:49:55,360
for days on end!

587
00:49:55,440 --> 00:49:57,320
It was already unacceptable!

588
00:49:58,080 --> 00:50:00,520
Yet you brought a threat to our household.

589
00:50:01,640 --> 00:50:03,680
Your brother's life
was nearly in jeopardy.

590
00:50:03,760 --> 00:50:06,480
-Phop!
-Boon is not my true brother, Father.

591
00:50:11,320 --> 00:50:12,480
Phop.

592
00:50:13,240 --> 00:50:16,280
I never raised you to be
disrespectful toward your father

593
00:50:16,360 --> 00:50:17,960
and Lady Bud.

594
00:50:18,800 --> 00:50:19,840
It is you, Aunt Bud,

595
00:50:20,360 --> 00:50:23,080
who brought Cherd
to cause chaos at our manor.

596
00:50:23,160 --> 00:50:26,120
I saw her exchange looks with him
with my own eyes.

597
00:50:29,480 --> 00:50:31,240
Where has it gone,

598
00:50:33,440 --> 00:50:34,760
the ring I bought for you

599
00:50:34,840 --> 00:50:36,960
on the Songkran of yesteryear?

600
00:50:39,240 --> 00:50:41,840
You bestowed the ring on Cherd,
did you not?

601
00:50:42,760 --> 00:50:44,680
It served as payment for his misdeeds,

602
00:50:44,760 --> 00:50:46,760
orchestrated to expel Klao
from this manor.

603
00:50:48,200 --> 00:50:49,360
Is this true, Lady Bud?

604
00:50:51,840 --> 00:50:53,440
It is not, Your Excellency.

605
00:50:54,240 --> 00:50:55,680
Phop has falsely accused me,

606
00:50:56,320 --> 00:50:58,320
for no other reason than protecting Klao,

607
00:51:02,440 --> 00:51:04,600
-as Phop and Klao are--
-Sister!

608
00:51:06,360 --> 00:51:07,600
A matter such as this,

609
00:51:07,680 --> 00:51:09,840
it is best we let Phop explain everything.

610
00:51:12,640 --> 00:51:13,840
What is amiss, Phop?

611
00:51:17,680 --> 00:51:20,760
What are you to Klao?

612
00:51:47,920 --> 00:51:49,680
I love him

613
00:51:49,760 --> 00:51:52,000
as one would love one's beloved, Father.

614
00:52:15,800 --> 00:52:18,440
I shall deem your words
a temporary lapse of judgment.

615
00:52:20,440 --> 00:52:23,320
Ponder upon this matter
until you are truly certain.

616
00:52:23,400 --> 00:52:26,120
I have never been more certain, Father.

617
00:52:29,760 --> 00:52:31,160
I love Klao,

618
00:52:32,360 --> 00:52:35,120
and my love for him
is no different from yours for Mother.

619
00:52:36,880 --> 00:52:37,960
Phop.

620
00:52:39,320 --> 00:52:40,920
I beg of you,

621
00:52:41,880 --> 00:52:44,160
say no more than this for your sake.

622
00:52:45,840 --> 00:52:47,320
No good

623
00:52:49,160 --> 00:52:50,960
can come from two men being together.

624
00:52:57,240 --> 00:52:58,720
Yet both of you,

625
00:53:00,200 --> 00:53:02,200
though a man and a woman,

626
00:53:02,280 --> 00:53:04,640
have hardly had a love that is any better.

627
00:53:11,440 --> 00:53:13,520
My heart belongs to Dear Klao
and him alone.

628
00:53:19,240 --> 00:53:22,960
And I shall never take another
into my heart, as you have done.

629
00:53:25,680 --> 00:53:26,520
Phop.

630
00:53:29,200 --> 00:53:30,400
Cease this.

631
00:53:38,440 --> 00:53:40,520
I shall find another place for you.

632
00:53:42,680 --> 00:53:43,880
Once found,

633
00:53:45,520 --> 00:53:48,240
pack your belongings
and be gone from here.

634
00:53:53,960 --> 00:53:54,800
Father!

635
00:53:55,560 --> 00:53:57,040
I shall not accept this.

636
00:54:08,920 --> 00:54:09,760
Mother!

637
00:54:12,760 --> 00:54:14,960
I beg of you,
speak to Father on my behalf.

638
00:54:17,720 --> 00:54:18,760
Mother!

639
00:54:27,080 --> 00:54:27,920
Phop.

640
00:54:29,400 --> 00:54:31,680
Your father will never understand this.

641
00:54:42,000 --> 00:54:43,320
Klao,

642
00:54:45,600 --> 00:54:47,960
I have never despised you.

643
00:54:49,240 --> 00:54:52,280
I've always cherished you as my own child.

644
00:54:57,080 --> 00:54:58,080
But I…

645
00:54:59,720 --> 00:55:01,320
I am unable to accept it,

646
00:55:01,960 --> 00:55:03,560
at least

647
00:55:06,840 --> 00:55:08,000
for the time being.

648
00:55:11,400 --> 00:55:12,320
Phop.

649
00:55:13,280 --> 00:55:15,640
Kindly look upon me with understanding.

650
00:56:11,880 --> 00:56:13,880
Weep no more, my dearest heart.

651
00:56:19,920 --> 00:56:22,120
Even if everything ends up like this,

652
00:56:23,640 --> 00:56:26,400
I promise my love for you
shall never fade.

653
00:56:30,680 --> 00:56:31,520
I know.

654
00:56:34,200 --> 00:56:36,840
I do not wish to let them down,

655
00:56:40,000 --> 00:56:42,320
but I too do not wish
to give up on our love.

656
00:57:02,960 --> 00:57:04,240
If such is the case,

657
00:57:07,080 --> 00:57:09,880
I call upon the Goddess of Water
to bear witness to my vow.

658
00:57:13,480 --> 00:57:15,400
I shall carve our path with my hands.

659
00:57:17,800 --> 00:57:20,800
Should Father truly
cast you out of the manor,

660
00:57:24,160 --> 00:57:26,560
I shall forsake all and depart with you.

661
00:57:28,440 --> 00:57:30,800
But they are your parents.

662
00:57:35,000 --> 00:57:37,800
Do you think
you can leave them behind that easily?

663
00:57:40,640 --> 00:57:42,040
It would not be easy,

664
00:57:47,040 --> 00:57:49,160
but it would be harder for me
to let you go.

665
00:57:53,920 --> 00:57:55,440
I promise you,

666
00:57:58,360 --> 00:58:01,000
I shall let nothing tear us apart.

667
00:58:04,440 --> 00:58:06,040
Everything shall resolve itself

668
00:58:07,280 --> 00:58:10,640
as long as we have each other,
as we do now.

669
00:58:42,920 --> 00:58:46,000
So long as Klao's madness

670
00:58:46,080 --> 00:58:47,320
does not subside,

671
00:58:48,400 --> 00:58:50,880
Phop is in no condition to wed.

672
00:58:57,320 --> 00:58:59,480
Therefore, I must postpone the ceremony.

673
00:59:00,720 --> 00:59:03,240
I shall set off to apologize

674
00:59:03,320 --> 00:59:05,520
to High Lord Dech Kraisor in person.

675
00:59:09,720 --> 00:59:10,920
A postponement

676
00:59:12,520 --> 00:59:14,600
is nothing but a rejection.

677
00:59:25,240 --> 00:59:26,240
If your love for Klao

678
00:59:27,440 --> 00:59:29,480
is so profound,

679
00:59:33,200 --> 00:59:35,040
then go forth and wed him.

680
00:59:44,040 --> 00:59:46,440
I sincerely apologize,
High Lord Horathibodi.

681
00:59:52,280 --> 00:59:54,560
I believe the one you should apologize to

682
00:59:56,520 --> 00:59:58,040
is Lady Varna,

683
00:59:58,560 --> 00:59:59,480
Lord Phop.

684
01:00:06,040 --> 01:00:07,160
Lady Varna,

685
01:00:07,760 --> 01:00:09,120
it is my fault.

686
01:00:09,960 --> 01:00:11,640
I beg for your forgiveness.

687
01:00:14,080 --> 01:00:15,560
Think no more of it, my Lord.

688
01:00:17,320 --> 01:00:18,640
I understand that

689
01:00:19,560 --> 01:00:22,680
your heart is not captivated
by my presence.

690
01:00:23,600 --> 01:00:24,760
Lady Varna.

691
01:00:25,280 --> 01:00:26,760
Blame not yourself, I beg.

692
01:00:27,720 --> 01:00:29,680
You are flawless in every way.

693
01:00:29,760 --> 01:00:31,800
The fault lies with Phop and me.

694
01:00:33,400 --> 01:00:35,320
It is no one's fault.

695
01:00:36,120 --> 01:00:37,480
In truth,

696
01:00:38,960 --> 01:00:41,320
I must convey my gratitude to Klao.

697
01:00:41,400 --> 01:00:43,520
He made me realize that

698
01:00:44,720 --> 01:00:47,120
I need not be anyone's wife

699
01:00:48,560 --> 01:00:50,720
to possess my own worth.

700
01:00:56,320 --> 01:00:58,440
Utter madness.

701
01:00:59,440 --> 01:01:00,560
The man

702
01:01:01,320 --> 01:01:03,480
refuses to wed
out of concern for his brother,

703
01:01:04,880 --> 01:01:06,760
whilst the lady

704
01:01:06,840 --> 01:01:10,120
possesses no desire to be any man's wife.

705
01:01:12,800 --> 01:01:13,840
If such is the case,

706
01:01:15,280 --> 01:01:16,360
I shall take my leave.

707
01:01:17,040 --> 01:01:20,960
Let us confer upon the opium case
at a later hour, High Lord.

708
01:01:44,680 --> 01:01:47,120
It's fortunate that Lady Varna understood.

709
01:01:47,200 --> 01:01:49,440
And it was a blessing
that it was the High Lord,

710
01:01:49,520 --> 01:01:50,840
Lady Varna's uncle.

711
01:01:52,560 --> 01:01:55,360
Had it been High Lord Dech Kraisor
in his place,

712
01:01:56,000 --> 01:01:58,840
the altercation would have escalated
far beyond that.

713
01:02:02,440 --> 01:02:03,680
It was because of me.

714
01:02:05,160 --> 01:02:07,160
I caused you and your parents

715
01:02:07,840 --> 01:02:09,400
so much trouble.

716
01:02:23,000 --> 01:02:23,960
No, you did not.

717
01:02:25,400 --> 01:02:28,440
It was Father who wished
to betroth me to her

718
01:02:29,560 --> 01:02:31,360
against my own will entirely.

719
01:02:33,720 --> 01:02:35,280
I did not dare to oppose him,

720
01:02:36,480 --> 01:02:39,720
as this is how he raised me
since I was a little child.

721
01:02:42,880 --> 01:02:44,520
Then you accepted my love.

722
01:02:55,600 --> 01:02:57,840
Stay by my side
for all the days to come, Klao.

723
01:02:59,640 --> 01:03:02,120
I have no wish to go anywhere else, do I?

724
01:03:03,720 --> 01:03:04,720
Indeed.

725
01:03:05,520 --> 01:03:07,160
Do not seek Cherd out either.

726
01:03:08,920 --> 01:03:11,000
He had the audacity
to march into our manor.

727
01:03:13,080 --> 01:03:16,240
Regardless of his conspiring
with Aunt Bud,

728
01:03:17,200 --> 01:03:19,120
his insolence is beyond measure.

729
01:03:21,640 --> 01:03:24,480
Should he find you out there after this,

730
01:03:24,560 --> 01:03:26,200
he would certainly not spare you.

731
01:03:30,920 --> 01:03:33,480
But Cherd definitely
has a wound on his arm.

732
01:03:33,560 --> 01:03:34,640
You saw it too.

733
01:03:35,840 --> 01:03:37,760
But why did your subordinate report that

734
01:03:37,840 --> 01:03:40,200
he was not found among the patrol units.

735
01:03:40,280 --> 01:03:41,720
Do you think it is peculiar?

736
01:03:45,560 --> 01:03:48,680
Kla has indeed been keeping
a close watch on Cherd.

737
01:03:50,560 --> 01:03:53,000
He and I have long been working together.

738
01:03:53,600 --> 01:03:54,880
He can be trusted.

739
01:05:22,080 --> 01:05:27,080
EXECUTE THE PLAN AT ONCE

740
01:05:29,400 --> 01:05:30,240
And…

741
01:05:31,680 --> 01:05:33,480
what about the wound on his arm?

742
01:05:33,560 --> 01:05:35,400
What would you say?

743
01:05:39,160 --> 01:05:41,120
We possess no concrete proof.

744
01:05:42,120 --> 01:05:44,760
Some unforeseen accident
might have caused it.

745
01:05:45,560 --> 01:05:48,000
Would not that be a coincidence?

746
01:05:51,040 --> 01:05:51,960
Anyhow,

747
01:05:52,960 --> 01:05:55,560
I must uncover more of the truth.

748
01:05:56,960 --> 01:05:59,520
If the location that my record mentioned

749
01:05:59,600 --> 01:06:01,440
really is the meeting place,

750
01:06:02,600 --> 01:06:04,600
then I must know where it is.

751
01:06:05,800 --> 01:06:08,960
And Pim's hesitation
and her refusal to speak

752
01:06:09,880 --> 01:06:10,840
signifies that

753
01:06:11,640 --> 01:06:13,120
she knows something.

754
01:07:03,360 --> 01:07:06,680
<i>Should your tongue slip,</i>
<i>I shall bring about your demise.</i>

755
01:07:27,920 --> 01:07:30,480
The fifteenth night of the waning moon.

756
01:07:32,440 --> 01:07:34,880
We previously seized the opium at Sam Khok

757
01:07:35,560 --> 01:07:37,440
approximately at this moon phase.

758
01:07:38,960 --> 01:07:40,360
Perchance,

759
01:07:41,040 --> 01:07:45,120
they schedule their illicit shipments
upon this precise night of every month.

760
01:07:46,200 --> 01:07:47,280
And…

761
01:07:47,360 --> 01:07:49,080
That is only a few days away.

762
01:07:50,440 --> 01:07:51,280
Yes.

763
01:07:52,960 --> 01:07:55,560
Should we converge upon
the designated hour and place,

764
01:07:56,920 --> 01:07:58,640
we shall undoubtedly capture Cherd.

765
01:08:02,400 --> 01:08:04,440
Should we manage to capture him,

766
01:08:06,000 --> 01:08:09,120
we could use him to trace
whoever framed my father.

767
01:08:11,040 --> 01:08:12,360
Phop!

768
01:08:13,960 --> 01:08:17,520
Tell me everything that you know
about my father.

769
01:08:49,800 --> 01:08:52,520
That's High Lord Sintaranurak's son.
He's effeminate.

770
01:08:52,600 --> 01:08:55,399
How peculiar.
Look how you protect one another.

771
01:08:55,479 --> 01:08:58,560
One might think you're husband and wife.
Or is it merely a fling?

772
01:09:00,560 --> 01:09:01,640
<i>Dear Klao.</i>

773
01:09:01,720 --> 01:09:04,439
<i>I've secured you a position</i>
<i>in Lavo's official service.</i>

774
01:09:04,520 --> 01:09:06,760
Gather your belongings
and depart on the morrow.

775
01:09:06,840 --> 01:09:09,160
But… I fear I am unable to depart.

776
01:09:10,560 --> 01:09:14,640
You wish for us to escort you into
the House of Pleasure?

777
01:09:14,720 --> 01:09:15,680
Yes.

778
01:09:15,760 --> 01:09:17,760
<i>Tonight is the night</i>
<i>of the waning moon.</i>

779
01:09:17,840 --> 01:09:19,560
<i>Cherd should smuggle opium tonight.</i>

780
01:09:19,640 --> 01:09:21,080
Pim!

781
01:09:23,920 --> 01:09:27,800
Grant me your forgiveness,
I beg of you, Klao.
